# The Anki FSRS-7 fork (FSRS-7, RWKV-Curve and RWKV-Instant; follows
# github.com/JSchoreels/anki) that the iPhone and iPad build instead of Anki's
# release ANKI_TAG (shared/versions.env), and that the host tests run
# (shared/tests/run.sh). Its Rust core (shared/tools/anki_source.sh --fork,
# with Kioku's patches) and its Python packages (shared/tools/anki_wheels.sh)
# are built from ANKI_FORK_COMMIT: they check each other's build hash.
#
# Move it by hand, to the commit the desktop fork you sync with runs:
# ANKI_FORK_VERSION is the fork's .version at that commit, the version Anki
# reports. Python, Qt, PyQt6 and the other pins in shared/versions.env must
# match the fork's (shared/tools/anki_pins.py check).
ANKI_FORK_REPO=https://github.com/ozonep/anki
ANKI_FORK_COMMIT=363035a2338c70f7675a70cddbe3a9620f0ea5af
ANKI_FORK_VERSION=26.09.4+fsrs7
